{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "1699a9e09c3d73ee04275fb644be4a0fd0886a1d25d05bc94992e7b8ce20433e", "ja": "くらえー！　うおりゃああああ！", "zh": "接招——！　呜哦啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fad51a071e94c2acd80573b78c20da64c3b558dd45e017291b787e63f4cbe656", "ja": "ぐわああああっ！\nぎ、ギブギブ！", "zh": "呜哇啊啊啊啊！\n投、投降投降！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "2a6eba52883e513408331a3f472909997d5f004482026594507df9627a62c5bd", "ja": "決まったーっ！　これで本番もバッチリだね！\n付き合ってくれてありがと、{$P$}。", "zh": "成了——！这样正式演出也肯定没问题了！\n谢谢你陪我练习，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1003_p", "source_sha256": "15c08fb3fb24784fb034fb4a9deae5ad361d516fac8531504655b6d9e15a2239", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……どういたしまして……。\n役に立ったなら何よりだ。", "zh": "呼，呼……不客气……  \n能帮上忙就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "ce0b07c59ecd48228a7221f33183084406dc99f67a507bbeb7c3df68a89b6cfb", "ja": "いや～。いろんな技が練習できて助かったよ！\n……って、体、大丈夫？", "zh": "哎呀～能练习各种招式，真是帮大忙了！\n……不过，你的身体没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5f6c0bb643705edd89be8606c6b61c3018fe539c61bca84c4b3588276a16f448", "ja": "な、なんとかな……。\nこれも、のり子のライブのためだ！", "zh": "总、总算还行吧……\n这也是为了演子的新演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "3f906014da57e59bc758fe069a98c80337ccd751938c8b80bb82b9257a04df18", "ja": "あー、よかった～！\nそれなら、とっておきの新技もやっちゃおうかな♪", "zh": "啊～太好了～！\n既然这样，要不要使出压箱底的新招式呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1007_p", "source_sha256": "18bfb30ea8a0bb9a084ad29b70ae0cdd4b538ddf35258463f2e7d2fce19e0dd5", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、とっておきなら、\n本番まで取っておいた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "诶！？不，既然是压箱底的新招，还是留到正式演出时再用比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "f43cfa6d3406aebc904e7e58ad2f7d8d42e85f4adc033a173bb5e0761da59037", "ja": "……そう？　ま、それもそうだね！\nそれにしても……ふふっ♪", "zh": "……是吗？嘛，说得也是！\n话虽如此……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a4d14b5b7ac5706c12b66bad682c238081555529989aa5ae24f11df9eda9a79d", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "ee7e1d3430b579265ac12b6dea583714a236a0bf1baf60c36396f19ef5a0acef", "ja": "なんか懐かしいなって思って。昔……兄貴と一緒に\nプロレスごっこしてたんだよね。今みたいな感じでさ。", "zh": "总觉得有点怀念呢。以前……我和哥哥一起玩过摔跤来着。就像现在这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f8abdd7fa488b37230a1489ac08ab9b9a628b3a03f32e97449678fc3e424e8b4", "ja": "そうだったのか。のり子は小さい頃から\nプロレスが大好きだったんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。原来纪子从小就特别喜欢摔跤啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "ac8f99ad6aea03c470d33871312cf6fc19dd5d9a3863dd9d3ef3b8ab33349134", "ja": "うん！　試合を見ながら、家族全員で一喜一憂してさ。\n気になった技は、兄貴と一緒に練習したりして。", "zh": "嗯！全家人一边看比赛，一边跟着时而高兴、时而担忧的。\n看到感兴趣的招式，我还会和哥哥一起练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "0a0f8337f880ab75c5b9089fd9e78e0a528182b7073c2be924b5186286a91382", "ja": "ドロップキックみたいな空中技は、危ないからって\nお父さんがアタシの体を持ち上げてくれてね……。", "zh": "像飞身踢这样的空中技很危险，所以爸爸会把我的身体举起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cd26df0d5c27d4e4d8a67d437e63832c8a390cb46814b909c4e0dfd7c9429f84", "ja": "ははっ、家族みんなでプロレスを楽しんでたんだな。\nいいご家族じゃないか。", "zh": "哈哈，一家人都很喜欢摔跤呢。\n真是个和睦的家庭啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "06cb7f8758af297d1aead33eccc1c15786d825095d9a139a7cc7b342e58d8cd8", "ja": "えへへ。でも、そんなアタシがアイドルになって、\nライブでプロレス技を披露するとか誰も思わないって。", "zh": "嘿嘿。不过，谁也没想到曾经那样的我会成为偶像，还会在演唱会上展示摔跤招式吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "aa9ef43ef3bdd88ad9ce5357350a906e7f829d0c04370745008eb92cedf10994", "ja": "小さい頃にやってた遊びがお仕事になるなんて……\nホント世の中、不思議だよね。", "zh": "小时候玩的游戏居然能变成工作……\n这个世界还真是不可思议呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5de15ef4bf649c31ea508bd69c5786297280de3b18a9cfab3d34ad4dc0a4acf0", "ja": "そうだな。自分の好きなものが仕事になったんだ。\nのり子の好きな気持ちを思う存分、伝えてきてくれ。", "zh": "是啊。自己喜欢的事物变成了工作。\n去尽情传达出你对喜欢之物的心意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "8028feb93282e7be7c4f29ac6e4398a166f0002495ff60b3bb8173a38d416f8c", "ja": "わかった！　{$P$}との練習を\n無駄にしないように、精一杯、思いをぶつけてくるよ！", "zh": "明白！为了不让和{$P$}一起练习的成果白费，我会尽全力把这份心意传达出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "2fbdc173543ea718561fdefb859bc68ec2af1f8cee5bf4396f7aa6f9b8cdb4df", "ja": "だからさ……一番近くで見てくれないかな？\nそうしたら、アタシも百人力っていうか……。", "zh": "所以说……你能不能在离我最近的地方看着我呢？\n那样的话，我就好像有百来个人给我撑腰一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a0e0c127ad1badba39d78c604cd1674c3cd864ccece8caee0be8c01629ff7999", "ja": "もちろん。\nライブ中もちゃんとのり子のサポートをするよ。", "zh": "当然了。\n演出中我也会好好支持法子的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0344_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0344_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "abe2211984840f020319cfaed5db17154711e43d57703c709f95a4013ec5abca", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nその言葉、約束だよ！　それじゃ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n你说的话，要算数哦！那我出发啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
